# 2.39.0 (f21db3fe): a node can be flashed from an image on the SD card
# (sdcard=1&file=<path>, confined to the card); sha256 is now checked for
# sdcard and local flashes; skip_crc=false no longer skips the CRC check.
# Reported by a user on Discord.
#
# Measured 2026-10-15: the PR build in CI's own container, against a
