sha256  5befd834500dff12f36136ee36db58987cf4715280e25a61ebe0bf7ced1631fe  bmcd-2027ba5e4eacb0baf76b1f68aadc0b5a5469ec3c-cargo2.tar.gz
#
# 2.41.0 (ed5d997c): the network page works on any bridge layout. The board's
# address is read from the primary interface rather than br0; a board without
# br0 is told so (409) instead of failing with a 500; a hand-written
# /etc/network/interfaces is replaced only on request and a copy is kept;
# last_revert says why; a file restored by hand is noticed. Reported by a user
# on Discord.
#
